    "detailed_description": "This is a short horror game that does not include anything other than &quot;opening doors&quot; and &quot;walking.&quot;<br />\r\nThere are no elements like ``escape from monsters'' like in traditional horror games.<br />\r\nJust listen and walk.<br />\r\nWe put a lot of effort into the sound, aiming for a worldview that is both normal and somewhat crazy.<br />\r\nThere is no troublesome reading material at all.<br />\r\nWhat you feel is correct and true.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the sound of &quot;silence&quot; and the voice that echoes in your head.",
